{
  "id": "226",
  "title": "The Most Difficult Mandarin Question",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-01-07",
  "synopsis": "There is a tricky Mandarin listening problem that even the Chinese get wrong sometimes. Can you get it right?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/310/92735b488f85957d815a03ca5f3746bcb87abb3c.mp3?1483460054",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "最难中文题\n\n    有这样一道中文听力题，难倒了许多人。\n    题目是这样的：我大舅去二舅家找三舅说四舅被五舅叫去和六舅一起借七舅放在八舅抽屉里的钱。请问，钱是谁的？\n    这道题就连中国人也不一定能答对。答案是：钱是七舅的。你答对了吗？",
    "traditional": "最難中文題\n\n    有這樣一道中文聽力題，難倒了許多人。\n    題目是這樣的：我大舅去二舅家找三舅說四舅被五舅叫去和六舅一起借七舅放在八舅抽屜裡的錢。請問，錢是誰的？\n    這道題就連中國人也不一定能答對。答案是：錢是七舅的。你答對了嗎？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Most Difficult Mandarin Question"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "有这样一道中文听力题，难倒了许多人。",
      "traditional": "有這樣一道中文聽力題，難倒了許多人。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu zhè yàng yí dào zhōng wén tīng lì tí nán dǎo le xǔ duō rén",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There is a Mandarin listening question that has stumped a lot of people."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "题目是这样的：",
      "traditional": "題目是這樣的：",
      "pinyin": "tí mù shì zhè yàng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我大舅去二舅家找三舅说四舅",
      "traditional": "我大舅去二舅家找三舅說四舅",
      "pinyin": "wǒ dà jiù qù èr jiù jiā zhǎo sān jiù shuō sì jiù",
      "english": "The question goes like this:"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "被五舅叫去和六舅一起借七舅放在八舅抽屉里的钱。",
      "traditional": "被五舅叫去和六舅一起借七舅放在八舅抽屜裡的錢。",
      "pinyin": "bèi wǔ jiù jiào qù hé liù jiù yì qǐ jiè qī jiù fàng zài bā jiù chōu ti lǐ de qián",
      "english": "“My first uncle went to my second uncle's house to find my third uncle to say that my fourth uncle .."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "请问，钱是谁的？",
      "traditional": "請問，錢是誰的？",
      "pinyin": "qǐng wèn qián shì shéi de",
      "english": ".. was told by my fifth uncle to go with my sixth uncle to borrow the money my seventh uncle put in my eight uncle's drawer.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Question: Who's money is it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "这道题就连中国人也不一定能答对。",
      "traditional": "這道題就連中國人也不一定能答對。",
      "pinyin": "zhè dào tí jiù lián zhōng guó rén yě bù yí dìng néng dá duì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "答案是：钱是七舅的。",
      "traditional": "答案是：錢是七舅的。",
      "pinyin": "dá àn shì qián shì qī jiù de",
      "english": "Even some Chinese people are unable to answer this question correctly."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "你答对了吗？",
      "traditional": "你答對了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ dá duì le ma",
      "english": "The answer is: It is the seventh uncle's money."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Did you get it right?"
    }
  ],
